    "content": "# Rebrand Checklist\n\n<p className=\"mt-2 text-xl text-muted-foreground\">Use this checklist when turning the starter into your own brand. It covers the active app shell, SEO, assets, links, and legal copy.</p>\n\n## What to replace first\n\n- Site name and tagline\n- Default SEO title and description\n- Social links and repository references\n- Favicon and Open Graph image\n- Legal company and contact details\n- Any leftover starter wording in public-facing pages\n\n## Brand shell checklist\n\n- [ ] Update the default title and description in `apps/web/app/layout.tsx`\n- [ ] Update the global SEO constants in `apps/web/lib/seo/seo-config.ts`\n- [ ] Update the header wordmark in `apps/web/components/layout/header.tsx`\n- [ ] Update the footer brand name, links, and attribution in `apps/web/components/layout/footer.tsx`\n\n## Asset checklist\n\n- [ ] Replace `apps/web/app/favicon.ico`\n- [ ] Replace `apps/web/app/opengraph-image.png`\n- [ ] Update `apps/web/app/opengraph-image.alt.txt`\n- [ ] Review branded images in `apps/web/public/img/**`\n- [ ] Review guide screenshots in `apps/web/public/guides/**` if they still show the old brand\n\n## Product copy checklist\n\n- [x] Move About page copy out of `apps/web/app/about/page.tsx` and into content-backed data\n- [ ] Review `packages/content/data/about/about.mdx`\n- [ ] Review `apps/web/components/sections/hero-section.tsx`\n- [ ] Review `apps/web/components/sections/faq-section.tsx`\n- [ ] Review starter-facing docs in `packages/content/data/docs/**`\n- [ ] Review any public page copy that still names the original starter brand\n\n## External links and handles checklist\n\n- [ ] Update social handles and `sameAs` links in `apps/web/lib/seo/seo-config.ts`\n- [ ] Update footer social links in `apps/web/components/layout/footer.tsx`\n- [ ] Update the submit destination in `apps/web/lib/github-issue.ts`\n- [ ] Update project and repo links in `apps/web/app/projects/page.tsx`\n- [ ] Update any docs or guides that still point at the old domain or repository\n\n## Legal and contact checklist\n\n- [x] Review and update `packages/content/data/legal/privacy.mdx`\n- [x] Review and update `packages/content/data/legal/terms.mdx`\n- [x] Review and update `packages/content/data/legal/cookies.mdx`\n- [ ] Replace domains, emails, company/operator names, and contact details\n- [ ] Update the “Last updated” date whenever legal copy changes\n\n## Runtime details worth deciding\n\n- [ ] Decide whether to rename the favorites storage key in `apps/web/contexts/favorites-context.tsx`\n- [ ] Decide whether to keep or replace the existing guide screenshots and starter example copy\n- [ ] Decide whether internal package names need to change now or can stay internal until later\n\n## Do not bulk-replace blindly\n\n- `data/websites.json` and `packages/content/data/websites/**` contain third-party names that should stay intact\n- Some guide screenshots may need to be re-recorded rather than string-replaced\n- GitHub links in docs and guides may be intentional examples, so verify them before changing\n\n## Suggested order\n\n1. Replace the shell and SEO strings\n2. Replace the repo, social, and submit links\n3. Replace the visual assets\n4. Update legal copy and contact details\n5. Run one final string sweep for old brand references\n6. Build and manually verify the public pages\n\n## Fast search commands\n\n```bash\nrg -n \"llms.txt Hub|llms.txt hub|llmstxthub|thedaviddias|David Dias|llms-txt-hub\" apps/web packages/content\n```\n\n```bash\nrg -n \"privacy@|legal@|support@|contact@\" packages/content/data/legal apps/web\n```\n\n## Verification checklist\n\n- [ ] The homepage title and description use the new brand\n- [ ] The header and footer show the new brand and external links\n- [ ] The favicon and Open Graph image are replaced\n- [ ] `/about`, `/privacy`, `/terms`, and `/cookies` no longer mention the old brand\n- [ ] `/submit` points to the correct repository and issue flow\n- [ ] `pnpm --filter web build` passes cleanly",
